# Power BI Desktop writes local state next to the project. None of it belongs in git:
# .pbi/ holds cache.abf (a copy of the imported data), localSettings.json (user and machine settings),
# unappliedChanges.json and editor state. Credentials are kept by Desktop outside the project folder.
**/.pbi/
*.abf
localSettings.json
cache.abf

# Binary report formats: this project is versioned as PBIP (TMDL + PBIR text) only.
*.pbix
*.pbit

# Exports and temp files
*.pdf
*.pptx
~$*
